---
title: GHOST — user journey
---
%% Intended design; not runtime evidence
flowchart TD
  Launch["Launch camera off"] --> First{"First launch?"}
  First -->|Yes| Onboard["Equal camera or shortcut choice"]
  First -->|No| Tray["Tray ready"]
  Onboard --> Choice{"Enable GHOST explicitly?"}
  Choice -->|Yes| Calibrate["Permission check and calibration"]
  Choice -->|No| Tray
  Calibrate --> CameraOK{"Camera usable?"}
  CameraOK -->|No| Retry["Retry or use shortcuts"]
  Retry --> Tray
  CameraOK -->|Yes| Tray
  Tray --> Capture["Explicit capture hides own visuals"]
  Capture --> Select["Frozen selection and adjustment"]
  Select --> Preview["Preview crop"]
  Preview --> Confirm{"Confirm?"}
  Confirm -->|Cancel| Discard["Dispose volatile buffers"]
  Confirm -->|Back| Select
  Confirm -->|Yes| Save["Commit cropped PNG and manifest"]
  Save --> OK{"Committed?"}
  OK -->|No| Recover["Explain failure and retry"]
  Recover --> Preview
  OK -->|Yes| Hidden["Hidden saved reference"]
  Hidden --> Recall["Hand pull or conventional shortcut"]
  Recall --> Use["View move resize pin scroll"]
  Use --> Dismiss["Dismiss; pins remain"]
  Dismiss --> Tray
  Discard --> Tray
